Run the re-test by hand to append a meaningful row to this log:

  ssh mapstone-dev "fpgahub pair lease acquire bridge1"
  scp v1-release/bitstreams/* mapstone-dev:/tmp/tidelink_deploy/
  ssh mapstone-dev "N_DEPLOYS=20 SETTLE=2 bash -s" \
    < pynq_host/scripts/bringup_reliability.sh \
    | tee -a v1-release/reliability.log
  # release lease (provide --token captured from acquire --json)

Expected: ~mean 14/16 across 20 iters, mirroring the morning baseline.

